+A configurable, terminal-rendered gomoku (五子棋, five-in-a-row) game
+implemented in Python with a configurable AI opponent.  Single-process,
+no network, no system writes — runs in any Linux terminal that supports
+UTF-8 (24 rows × 60 columns minimum).
 
-## 1. 特性一览
+This package is the **code** deliverable for the `gomoku/gomoku`
+requirement (`workspace/gomoku/plans/gomoku-r1.md`).  See the plan and
